flowchart TD
  A[Build queued] --> B[Worker build poll loop]
  B --> C[Lease build job]
  C --> D[Status leased and attempts increment]
  D --> E[Settings overlay and worker config check]
  E --> F[Runtime and pack bootstrap]
  F --> G[Runner executes build]
  G -->|stream logs| H[Log chunks stored broadcast and touch active build]
  G -->|success| I[Store artifacts and update status]
  I --> J[Emit built event final log entry and attempt metadata]
  G -->|failure| K[Auto fix evaluates logs]
  K -->|persist evidence| L[Failure stage excerpt recipes and remediation source stored]
  L -->|apply recipes| M[Retry with backoff]
  M --> C
  K -->|no recipes or blocked| N[Mark failed]
  N --> J
  I --> O{Repair enabled}
  O -->|yes| P[Run repair tool and store repaired wheel]
  O -->|no| Q[Done]
  P --> Q
